---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy — Good Apollo Goods"
  description="Good Apollo Goods privacy policy."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy policy."
    intro="A plain-language summary of how information is handled when you visit or shop with Good Apollo Goods."
  />
  <section class="container policy">
    <p class="policy-date">Last updated September 2026</p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>
      When you order, Good Apollo Goods receives your name, email, shipping
      address and order details to fulfill your purchase and provide support.
      Stripe handles payment information through its hosted checkout. The studio
      does not store your full card number. Messages you send to the studio are
      used to answer your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
      Information is used only to operate the shop, complete purchases,
      communicate about orders or inquiries, and meet legal obligations. Good
      Apollo Goods does not sell personal information.
    </p>
    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p>
      Hosting, database, private photo storage, payment, email and shipping
      providers process information needed to operate the shop. Their own
      privacy terms also apply. Order records are kept for fulfillment, support
      and required business records. Contact the studio about access to or
      deletion of your information; some records may need to be retained.
    </p>
    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      Newsletter signup is optional and separate from purchases and store
      accounts. If you choose to subscribe, Good Apollo Goods will use the
      shared Mautic service and Google Workspace mail provider to manage your
      confirmed newsletter subscription and send Good Apollo Goods newsletter
      messages. A confirmation step is required before subscription. You can
      withdraw newsletter permission through the preference link in a
      newsletter; withdrawal does not affect order, shipment, sign-in or
      support messages. A limited permission and withdrawal history is kept to
      honor your choice and maintain the subscription audit. Contact
      hello@goodapollogoods.com with newsletter privacy questions. The
      newsletter feature is currently closed, and no subscriber list has been
      imported.
    </p>
    <h2>Browser storage</h2>
    <p>
      The site saves your cart in your browser and uses a guest checkout cookie
      to protect your order link. The operator area uses separate sign-in
      cookies. Clearing your cookies can prevent access to your order status;
      email the studio from your purchase email if you need help.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:hello@goodapollogoods.com">hello@goodapollogoods.com</a>{' '}
      with privacy questions.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
